  "description": "Avid BL lover Min Kirin attends a game expo to get some new BL games, but there are disappointingly few there. He nearly goes home empty-handed, but a mysterious, hooded man gives him a free copy of a VR BL game. Kirin is suspicious of the man and game, especially given the negative reviews, but he can't resist its mature rating and logs in just to be transported into that world! He needs to earn money and that's how he meets the various romanceable characters. Will Kirin find love with one of them and return to reality, or will he be unable to pick just one virtual hottie?!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
